  "ingredients": [
    "4 slices bacon, or more to taste",
    "3 pounds potatoes, or more to taste, peeled and cut into chunks",
    "0.5 cup butter, cut into pieces",
    "1 (16 ounce) container sour cream",
    "8 ounces shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "0.5 chopped fresh chives",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LkcNSDE5c5d67YW6lBOwM9pi89k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240157-loaded-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-4x3-01-86c4762121da44f8a3e9248274a9ab27.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240157/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place bacon in a large skillet and cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until crisp and browned, about 10 minutes; drain on paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e2e64edyoYSUz3ftt_GlqyH6zIY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240157-loaded-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-4x3-02-e2774800dc404ece8f949de938ade10b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240157/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, place potatoes into a large pot of lightly salted water and bring to a boil; reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes. Drain well and return potatoes to the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EpD0m69z1dxHPRGR6OGuOvqayKs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240157-loaded-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-4x3-03-932f8bcfb8b241f181568394a985fb17.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240157/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash butter into the potatoes using a potato masher or electric hand mixer until well combined. Add sour cream and continue to mash or beat until combined. Crumble bacon into potato mixture; stir in Cheddar cheese and chives. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/t9c0PzpZK6ilH9VwhKEVQezFq9A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240157-loaded-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-4x3-04-b8cb55e0205044fc8f9fb45b5cf2935f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240157/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-5RLElaA1lbU87SFbTcBMCaPkF8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240157-loaded-mashed-potatoes-ddmfs-hero-4x3-02f5d298a55a40c7a428a774d407a0ce.jpg"
      ],
